          "items": [
            "Recommended workflow use: Architecture and impact, Development, Tests and review. Use when an affected Spring Boot endpoint or persistence behavior needs an interface decision, implementation change and boundary-specific verification. This is an Atlas recommendation reviewed on 2026-10-15, not a mandatory process or an observed execution result.",
            "Check output to obtain: Record the actual Boot, Framework and dependency releases, endpoint stack and security or transaction configuration.",
            "Check output to obtain: Observe malformed-input and denied-save behavior independently through the intended application boundary.",
            "Check output to obtain: Identify whether each test uses a mock or running server, how data is cleaned up and which database or transaction failure paths remain unrun."
          ]
